    <task id="Id_6bdd290a-410b-425c-b792-cf0f9a7ea16b" name="5.7.4 Analisar a documentação entregue">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Esta &amp;eacute; a &amp;uacute;ltima etapa do processo de entrega do modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es como uma troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para a contratante e sua aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o como informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es publicadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante analisa as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es enviadas e, ao fazer isso, se preocupa em verificar se as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es foram entregues de acordo com os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto (como, por exemplo, o cumprimento dos procedimentos de seguran&amp;ccedil;a).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante deve verificar o conte&amp;uacute;do do cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. seus requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es (EIR), incluindo quaisquer crit&amp;eacute;rios de aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o especificados no EIR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. as entregas listadas no plano mestre de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es (MIDP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. o n&amp;iacute;vel necess&amp;aacute;rio de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para cada requisito de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_a20f4337-7e5b-4818-b531-3bbf4acb90e7</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_623fdcee-8d27-41e7-9872-c1f53dfccd2e</outgoing>
